# Commands that Debian installs under another name, because another package has the name (Debian Policy 10.1).
# command-not-found names the package of each row first, with the name to run, and the packages that have the
# command under its own name after it. Made by make-renamed.py from Debian forky's Contents, Packages and
# popularity contest and each source's own README.Debian, NEWS or changelog (the file named per row).
# Each row: the command, the package, the name it is installed as; the line above it names the Debian text.
# antlr 2.7.7+dfsg-14, debian/changelog
antlr	antlr	runantlr
# rust-bat 0.26.1+ds-1, debian/README.Debian
bat	bat	batcat
# iraf 2.18.2-4, debian/README.Debian
cl	iraf	irafcl
# rust-fd-find 10.5.0-1, debian/README.Debian
fd	fd-find	fdfind
